<section class="page-intro"><a href="/" class="breadcrumb">Home / Our world</a><span class="eyebrow">Demo Wear</span><h1>A point of view.<br/><em>Entirely your own.</em></h1><p>Styled your way, every day.</p></section><section class="fashion-story about-story"><div class="fashion-story-photo"><img src="@Shop.Settings.Story" alt="The collection of Demo Wear" width="900" height="1200"/></div><div class="fashion-story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT US</span><h2>Get to know<br/><em>the collection.</em></h2><p>From a beautifully layered outfit to a relaxed coordinated set, discover the photographs and details of the Demo Wear edit. The boutique’s locations include Bir el Abed, Nweiri and Khaldah. Speak with the Nweiri team to confirm your favourite look and plan your visit.</p><p>Take your time with the collection. Save your favourites, explore the photographs and bring your questions to the team.</p><a class="button" href="/shop">Explore the collection ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="@Shop.Settings.Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit our Instagram ↗</a></div></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Your own way to explore.</h2><p>Discover the photographed looks, keep a list of favourites and send a personal enquiry. Colours, sizing, availability and ordering details are confirmed directly with the team.</p><a class="text-link" href="/lookbook">Open the visual diary ↗</a></section>
